<title>SINGAPORE: ABR Holdings 1st-half net falls.</title>
<headline>ABR Holdings 1st-half net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.06  vs   0.36</p>
<p>    EPS (cents)			    0.1   vs   0.8</p>
<p>    Turnover				14.21  vs  14.78</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	0.52  vs   0.55</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization	  0.76  vs   0.75</p>
<p>    Loss from associates		 0.39  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Tax					0.08  vs   0.39</p>
<p>    Minorities		    (loss) 0.03  vs   0.74 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - ABR Holdings operates a chain of ice-cream parlours.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
